msgid "Send a request"
msgstr "发送请求"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:123
msgid ""
"The model name in the request body must match the "
"``model.aibrix.ai/name`` label in your deployment:"
msgstr "请求体中的模型名必须与 Deployment 中的 ``model.aibrix.ai/name`` 标签一致："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:136
msgid "Authentication"
msgstr "认证"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:140
msgid ""
"AIBrix exposes a public endpoint to the internet. Enable authentication "
"to secure it. For vLLM backends, pass the ``--api-key`` argument or set "
"the ``VLLM_API_KEY`` environment variable to require an API key in the "
"``Authorization`` header. See `vLLM OpenAI-Compatible Server "
"<https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/getting_started/quickstart.html#openai-"
"compatible-server>`_ for details."
msgstr ""
"AIBrix 会向公网暴露端点。请启用认证以保护它。对 vLLM 后端，传入 ``--api-key`` 参数或设置 "
"``VLLM_API_KEY`` 环境变量，以要求 ``Authorization`` 请求头中带 API key。详见 `vLLM "
"OpenAI-Compatible Server "
"<https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/getting_started/quickstart.html#openai-"
"compatible-server>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:144
msgid ""
"After enabling authentication, include the ``Authorization`` header in "
"every request:"
msgstr "启用认证后，每个请求都要带 ``Authorization`` 请求头："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:158
msgid "Expose custom paths"
msgstr "暴露自定义路径"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:160
msgid ""
"As of v0.5.0, each model's ``HTTPRoute`` is created with a default set of"
" path prefixes (e.g. ``/v1/chat/completions``, ``/v1/completions``). To "
"expose additional custom paths, add the ``model.aibrix.ai/model-router-"
"custom-paths`` annotation to your ``Deployment``, ``ModelAdapter``, or "
"``RayClusterFleet`` manifest:"
msgstr ""
"自 v0.5.0 起，每个模型的 ``HTTPRoute`` 会带一组默认路径前缀（例如 ``/v1/chat/completions`` "
"、``/v1/completions`` ）。要暴露额外自定义路径，在 ``Deployment`` 、``ModelAdapter`` 或 "
"``RayClusterFleet`` 清单上添加 ``model.aibrix.ai/model-router-custom-paths`` "
"annotation："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:177
msgid "Routing Strategies"
msgstr "路由策略"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:180
msgid "Selecting a strategy"
msgstr "选择策略"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:182
msgid ""
"The routing strategy controls how the gateway selects the target pod for "
"each request. It can be set per request via the ``routing-strategy`` "
"header, per model via a :ref:`config profile <config_profiles>`, or "
"globally via the ``ROUTING_ALGORITHM`` environment variable. When more "
"than one is set, :ref:`routing_strategy_priority` decides which one wins."
msgstr ""
"路由策略决定网关如何为每个请求选择目标 Pod。可以通过 ``routing-strategy`` 请求头按请求设置，通过 "
":ref:`config profile <config_profiles>` 按模型设置，或通过 ``ROUTING_ALGORITHM`` "
"环境变量全局设置。同时设置多项时，由 :ref:`routing_strategy_priority` 决定哪一项生效。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:184
msgid ""
"To override the strategy for a single request, pass the ``routing-"
"strategy`` header with any of the strategy names listed below:"
msgstr "要为单个请求覆盖策略，请传入 ``routing-strategy`` 请求头，取值为下列任一策略名称："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:197
msgid ""
"Some strategies rely on metrics queried from the Prometheus HTTP API "
"(PromQL). See :ref:`prometheus-api-access` for configuration."
msgstr ""
"部分策略依赖从 Prometheus HTTP API（PromQL）查询的指标。配置见 :ref:`prometheus-api-access`"
" 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:200
msgid "General load balancing"
msgstr "通用负载均衡"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:202
msgid ""
"``random``: routes to a randomly selected pod. Suitable as a baseline or "
"when all pods are equivalent."
msgstr "``random`` ：路由到随机选取的 Pod。适合作为基线，或所有 Pod 等价时使用。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:203
msgid "``least-request``: routes to the pod with the fewest in-flight requests."
msgstr "``least-request`` ：路由到正在处理请求数最少的 Pod。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:204
msgid ""
"``least-request-top-k``: like ``least-request``, but spreads load across "
"the least-loaded pods so that several gateway replicas deciding at the "
"same moment don't all send their next request to the same pod."
msgstr ""
"``least-request-top-k`` ：类似 ``least-request`` ，但会把负载分散到负载最低的若干 Pod "
"上，避免多个网关副本在同一时刻决策时把下一个请求都发往同一个 Pod。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:206
msgid ""
"**Candidates:** the ready pods that are both among the ``K`` least-loaded"
" and within ``epsilon`` requests of the least-loaded pod. One of them is "
"picked uniformly at random."
msgstr ""
"**候选集：** 同时满足“属于负载最低的 ``K`` 个”和“与负载最低的 Pod 相差不超过 ``epsilon`` 个请求”的就绪 "
"Pod。从中均匀随机选取一个。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:207
msgid ""
"**Ramp penalty:** a newly ready pod gets a temporary penalty that decays "
"over a window, so it isn't flooded before it warms up."
msgstr "**爬坡惩罚：** 新就绪的 Pod 会获得一个随时间窗口衰减的临时惩罚，避免其在预热完成前被大量请求涌入。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:208
msgid ""
"**Tuning:** ``AIBRIX_ROUTING_LEAST_REQUEST_TOP_K`` (default ``5``), "
"``AIBRIX_ROUTING_LEAST_REQUEST_TOP_K_EPSILON`` (default ``4``) and "
"``AIBRIX_ROUTING_LEAST_REQUEST_TOP_K_RAMP_WINDOW`` (default ``300s``, "
"``0`` disables the ramp). See ``pkg/plugins/gateway/ENV_VARS.md``."
msgstr ""
"**调优：** ``AIBRIX_ROUTING_LEAST_REQUEST_TOP_K`` （默认 ``5`` "
"）、``AIBRIX_ROUTING_LEAST_REQUEST_TOP_K_EPSILON`` （默认 ``4`` ）和 "
"``AIBRIX_ROUTING_LEAST_REQUEST_TOP_K_RAMP_WINDOW`` （默认 ``300s`` ，``0`` "
"表示关闭爬坡）。详见 ``pkg/plugins/gateway/ENV_VARS.md`` 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:210
msgid ""
"``least-busy-time``: routes to the pod with the least cumulative busy "
"processing time."
msgstr "``least-busy-time`` ：路由到累计繁忙处理时间最短的 Pod。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:211
msgid ""
"``least-latency``: routes to the pod with the lowest average processing "
"latency."
msgstr "``least-latency`` ：路由到平均处理延迟最低的 Pod。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:212
msgid ""
"``least-kv-cache``: routes to the pod with the smallest KV cache "
"occupancy (least VRAM used)."
msgstr "``least-kv-cache`` ：路由到 KV cache 占用最小（VRAM 使用最少）的 Pod。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:213
msgid ""
"``least-utilization``: routes to the pod with the lowest overall "
"utilization score."
msgstr "``least-utilization`` ：路由到综合利用率分数最低的 Pod。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:214
msgid ""
"``load-balance``: capacity-aware weighted least-request routing. Faster "
"hardware is learned dynamically and receives proportionally more traffic."
" See ``pkg/plugins/gateway/algorithms/load_balance.md`` for details."
msgstr ""
"``load-balance`` ：感知容量的加权 least-request 路由。系统会动态学习更快的硬件，并按比例为其分配更多流量。详见 "
"``pkg/plugins/gateway/algorithms/load_balance.md`` 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:216
msgid "Each pod is scored, and the pod with the lowest score is selected:"
msgstr "对每个 Pod 打分，并选择得分最低的 Pod："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:222
msgid ""
"``EWMA(output_tokens_per_second)`` is the gateway-observed rate at which "
"the pod completes output tokens."
msgstr "``EWMA(output_tokens_per_second)`` 是网关观测到的该 Pod 完成输出 token 的速率。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:223
msgid "``kv_free`` is the pod's free KV-cache fraction."
msgstr "``kv_free`` 是该 Pod 空闲 KV cache 的比例。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:224
msgid ""
"``λ`` defaults to ``0`` (the running count already includes requests "
"queued in the engine) and ``α`` to ``2``."
msgstr "``λ`` 默认为 ``0`` （运行中请求数已包含引擎内排队的请求）， ``α`` 默认为 ``2`` 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:225
msgid ""
"**Tuning:** ``λ``, ``α`` and the free-KV-cache threshold below are set "
"with ``AIBRIX_LOAD_BALANCE_QUEUED_WEIGHT``, "
"``AIBRIX_LOAD_BALANCE_KV_PRESSURE_ALPHA`` and "
"``AIBRIX_LOAD_BALANCE_KV_CRITICAL_FREE``, respectively."
msgstr ""
"**调优：** ``λ`` 、``α`` 以及下文的空闲 KV cache 阈值，分别通过 "
"``AIBRIX_LOAD_BALANCE_QUEUED_WEIGHT`` "
"、``AIBRIX_LOAD_BALANCE_KV_PRESSURE_ALPHA`` 和 "
"``AIBRIX_LOAD_BALANCE_KV_CRITICAL_FREE`` 设置。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:227
msgid "Edge cases:"
msgstr "边界情况："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:229
#, python-format
msgid ""
"**KV guardrail:** a pod with less than 10% free KV cache scores ``+Inf`` "
"and is skipped. If every pod is below that threshold, the request still "
"routes to the pod with the most KV headroom."
msgstr ""
"**KV 保护：** 空闲 KV cache 低于 10% 的 Pod 得分为 ``+Inf`` ，会被跳过。若所有 Pod "
"都低于该阈值，请求仍会被路由，目标是 KV 余量最多的 Pod。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:230
msgid ""
"**Missing KV metrics:** a pod whose engine reports no KV-cache usage, or "
"reports ``NaN``, is treated as fully free (no penalty and no guardrail)."
msgstr "**缺少 KV 指标：** 引擎未上报 KV cache 使用量，或上报 ``NaN`` 的 Pod，视为完全空闲（既无惩罚，也不触发保护）。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:231
msgid ""
"**No token-rate estimate yet:** the pod is scored at the mean estimate of"
" the others (uniform capacity when none has one)."
msgstr "**尚无 token 速率估计：** 该 Pod 按其他 Pod 的平均估计值打分（若都没有估计值，则视为容量一致）。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:232
msgid ""
"**Ties:** broken using least combined GPU+CPU KV-cache usage, falling "
"back to a random pick if cache metrics are unavailable for the tied pods."
msgstr "**平局：** 按 GPU 与 CPU 合计 KV cache 使用量最少者决出；若平局的 Pod 没有缓存指标，则回退为随机选择。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:234
msgid ""
"``throughput``: routes to the pod that has processed the fewest total "
"weighted tokens, favoring underloaded pods."
msgstr "``throughput`` ：路由到已处理加权 token 总数最少的 Pod，偏向负载较低的 Pod。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:235
msgid ""
"``power-of-two``: applies power-of-two-choices — randomly samples two "
"pods and selects the better one."
msgstr "``power-of-two`` ：采用 power-of-two-choices——随机抽取两个 Pod 并选择更优者。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:238
msgid "KV-cache aware"
msgstr "KV-cache 感知"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:240
msgid ""
"``prefix-cache``: routes to a pod that already holds a KV cache matching "
"the request's prompt prefix, selecting the best prefix-matched pod within"
" a configurable stddev threshold. See :doc:`prefix-cache-aware-routing` "
"for the full guide."
msgstr ""
"``prefix-cache`` ：路由到已持有与请求 prompt 前缀匹配的 KV cache 的 "
"Pod，在可配置的标准差阈值内选择前缀匹配最好的 Pod。完整指南见 :doc:`prefix-cache-aware-routing` 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:242
msgid ""
"**Load:** it is purely about prefix caching and does not itself gate on "
"cluster-wide load imbalance; the gateway applies the :ref:`load-imbalance"
" gate <load_imbalance_gate>` centrally ahead of it."
msgstr ""
"**负载：** 它只关注前缀缓存，自身不对集群范围的负载不均衡设限；网关会在它之前统一应用 :ref:`负载不均衡门控 "
"<load_imbalance_gate>` 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:243
msgid ""
"**Modes:** standard (local hash table) or KV sync (real-time distributed "
"index, enabled with ``AIBRIX_PREFIX_CACHE_KV_EVENT_SYNC_ENABLED=true``)."
msgstr ""
"**模式：** 标准模式（本地哈希表）或 KV sync 模式（实时分布式索引，通过 "
"``AIBRIX_PREFIX_CACHE_KV_EVENT_SYNC_ENABLED=true`` 启用）。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:244
msgid ""
"**Chat requests:** the matched text starts with a canonical rendering of "
"``tools`` when present, because chat templates commonly render tools "
"ahead of the messages. Set ``AIBRIX_PREFIX_CACHE_INCLUDE_TOOLS=false`` to"
" match on messages only. In KV sync mode, chat requests tokenized through"
" the remote chat template carry their ``tools``, so the template places "
"them."
msgstr ""
"**Chat 请求：** 匹配文本以 ``tools`` 的规范化渲染结果开头（若存在），因为 chat 模板通常把 tools 渲染在 "
"messages 之前。设置 ``AIBRIX_PREFIX_CACHE_INCLUDE_TOOLS=false`` 则仅按 messages "
"匹配。在 KV sync 模式下，经远程 chat 模板分词的 chat 请求会携带其 ``tools`` ，由模板决定它们的位置。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:246
msgid ""
"``prefix-cache-preble``: routes considering both prefix cache hits and "
"pod load, based on `Preble: Efficient Distributed Prompt Scheduling for "
"LLM Serving <https://arxiv.org/abs/2407.00023>`_."
msgstr ""
"``prefix-cache-preble`` ：同时考虑 prefix cache 命中和 Pod 负载进行路由，基于 `Preble: "
"Efficient Distributed Prompt Scheduling for LLM Serving "
"<https://arxiv.org/abs/2407.00023>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:249
msgid "Fairness"
msgstr "公平性"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:251
msgid ""
"``vtc-basic``: routes using a hybrid score that balances per-user token "
"fairness and pod utilization. A simplified variant of the Virtual Token "
"Counter (VTC) algorithm. See `VTC-artifact <https://github.com/Ying1123"
"/VTC-artifact>`_ for background."
msgstr ""
"``vtc-basic`` ：使用混合分数路由，在每用户 token 公平性与 Pod 利用率之间平衡。是 Virtual Token "
"Counter（VTC）算法的简化变体。背景见 `VTC-artifact <https://github.com/Ying1123/VTC-"
"artifact>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:254
msgid "SLO-aware"
msgstr "SLO 感知"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:256
msgid "``slo``: routes with awareness of per-request service-level objectives."
msgstr "``slo`` ：按每请求的服务水平目标进行路由。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:257
msgid ""
"``slo-pack-load``: SLO-aware routing that consolidates load onto fewer "
"pods."
msgstr "``slo-pack-load`` ：SLO 感知路由，将负载集中到更少的 Pod。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:258
msgid ""
"``slo-least-load``: SLO-aware routing that spreads load to the least "
"loaded pod."
msgstr "``slo-least-load`` ：SLO 感知路由，将负载分散到负载最低的 Pod。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:259
msgid ""
"``slo-least-load-pulling``: variant of ``slo-least-load`` that pulls "
"metrics directly instead of using cached snapshots."
msgstr "``slo-least-load-pulling`` ：``slo-least-load`` 的变体，直接拉取指标而非使用缓存快照。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:262
msgid "Specialized"
msgstr "专用策略"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:264
msgid ""
"``pd``: prefill-decode disaggregation routing. Splits processing between "
"dedicated prefill pods and decode pods for optimized end-to-end latency. "
"See :doc:`pd-disaggregation` for the full guide."
msgstr ""
"``pd`` ：prefill-decode 分离路由。将处理拆分到专用 prefill Pod 和 decode "
"Pod，以优化端到端延迟。完整指南见 :doc:`pd-disaggregation` 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:277
msgid ""
"``session-affinity``: sticky session routing that keeps related requests "
"on the same pod. Two headers can drive it: the gateway-issued ``x"
"-session-id`` and the caller-owned ``x-aibrix-session-key``. See :doc"
":`agentic-routing` for the full guide."
msgstr ""
"``session-affinity``：粘滞会话路由，尽可能把相关请求打到同一 Pod。可由两个头驱动：网关签发的 "
"``x-session-id``，以及调用方自有的 ``x-aibrix-session-key``。完整指南见 "
":doc:`agentic-routing`。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:284
#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:1128
msgid "``x-session-id``"
msgstr "``x-session-id``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:285
#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:1131
msgid "``x-aibrix-session-key``"
msgstr "``x-aibrix-session-key``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:286
msgid "Issued by"
msgstr "签发方"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:287
msgid "The gateway, in the response header"
msgstr "网关，通过响应头返回"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:288
msgid "The caller"
msgstr "调用方"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:289
msgid "Available from"
msgstr "可用起点"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:290
msgid "The second request"
msgstr "第二个请求"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:291
msgid "The first request"
msgstr "第一个请求"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:292
msgid "Value"
msgstr "取值"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:293
msgid "Base64-encoded pod address (``IP:Port``)"
msgstr "经 base64 编码的 Pod 地址（``IP:Port`` ）"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:294
msgid "Any stable, opaque identifier"
msgstr "任意稳定且不透明的标识符"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:295
msgid "Best for"
msgstr "适用场景"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:296
msgid "Sequential multi-turn conversations"
msgstr "顺序的多轮对话"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:297
msgid "Concurrent agentic requests"
msgstr "并发的 agentic 请求"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:299
msgid ""
"Sequential multi-turn chat uses ``x-session-id``: the first response "
"carries the header, and the client sends it back unchanged. Concurrent "
"agentic work uses ``x-aibrix-session-key``: the caller supplies a stable "
"opaque key from the first request. If a request carries both, the gateway"
" uses ``x-session-id`` first and falls back to ``x-aibrix-session-key`` "
"when it does not resolve to a ready pod. Neither header is a security "
"token, and keys longer than 256 bytes are treated as unset."
msgstr ""
"顺序多轮对话使用 ``x-session-id``：首次响应带上该头，客户端原样回传。并发 agent 工作使用 "
"``x-aibrix-session-key``：调用方从第一次请求起就提供一个稳定的不透明键。若请求同时携带两者，网关先用 "
"``x-session-id``，无法解析到就绪 Pod 时再回退到 ``x-aibrix-session-key``。这两个头都不是安全令牌；超过 "
"256 字节的键视为未设置。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:301
msgid ""
"``external``: delegates replica selection to an operator-run HTTP service"
" after AIBrix has resolved the model and filtered unsafe replicas. "
"Experimental. See :doc:`external-replica-routing` for the protocol, "
"policy modes, and configuration."
msgstr ""
"``external``：在 AIBrix 解析模型并过滤不安全副本之后，把副本选择委托给运营方自行运行的 HTTP "
"服务。实验特性。协议、策略模式和配置见 :doc:`external-replica-routing`。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:306
msgid "Load-imbalance gate"
msgstr "负载不均衡门控"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:308
msgid ""
"The load-imbalance gate restricts candidates to the least-loaded pods "
"when load is severely skewed. The gateway applies it centrally, ahead of "
"whichever strategy actually routes each request, not just when ``load-"
"balance`` itself is selected. See ``pkg/plugins/gateway/ENV_VARS.md``."
msgstr ""
"负载不均衡门控会在负载严重倾斜时，把候选范围限制为负载最低的 Pod。网关会在实际负责路由的任何策略之前统一应用它，而不仅限于选择 ``load-"
"balance`` 本身的时候。详见 ``pkg/plugins/gateway/ENV_VARS.md`` 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:311
msgid "Auto-blended capacity awareness"
msgstr "自动混合的容量感知"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:313
msgid ""
"This auto-blend is **enabled by default** — no opt-in is required. The "
"gateway silently blends ``load-balance``'s capacity-aware scoring in "
"behind the strategy you select. This keeps any single strategy from "
"steering traffic at an already-hot pod, even outside the :ref:`load-"
"imbalance gate <load_imbalance_gate>`."
msgstr ""
"这种自动混合 **默认启用** ，无需显式开启。网关会在你所选策略的背后，悄悄混入 ``load-balance`` 的容量感知打分。这样即使在 "
":ref:`负载不均衡门控 <load_imbalance_gate>` 之外，也能避免任何单一策略把流量引向已经过热的 Pod。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:315
msgid ""
"The caller never sees this: ``ctx.Algorithm``, response headers, and "
"``Validate()`` all still reflect exactly the strategy that was requested."
msgstr "调用方感知不到这一点： ``ctx.Algorithm`` 、响应头和 ``Validate()`` 反映的仍然是所请求的策略。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:317
msgid "What is blended, by strategy:"
msgstr "各策略的混合情况："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:319
msgid ""
"**Most strategies:** every strategy above gets the ``load-balance`` "
"scorer, except the ones listed below. ``least-request-top-k`` is blended "
"in too, when the selected strategy doesn't already route by request "
"count, to keep multi-port/data-parallel pod routing working under the "
"blend."
msgstr ""
"**大多数策略：** 上文所列的每种策略都会被混入 ``load-balance`` "
"打分器，下列例外除外。当所选策略本身并不按请求数路由时，还会混入 ``least-request-top-k`` ，以保证多端口/数据并行 Pod"
" 的路由在混合下仍能正常工作。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:320
msgid ""
"**Bare** ``prefix-cache``: uses a dedicated 5:4 (1.25:1) lean toward "
"cache affinity over ``load-balance`` and does not receive ``least-"
"request-top-k``, so cache locality wins an exact-tie disagreement."
msgstr ""
"**单独使用的** ``prefix-cache`` ：使用专门的 5:4（1.25:1）比例，偏向缓存亲和性而非 ``load-"
"balance`` ，且不会混入 ``least-request-top-k`` ，因此在两者出现完全平局且意见不一致时，缓存局部性胜出。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:321
msgid ""
"**Bare** ``session-affinity``: gets no auto-blend at all. Its scoring is "
"binary (the resolved pod vs. everything else), so any ``load-balance`` "
"weight small enough to still lose an exact tie could never override the "
"pin either. Blending it in would be dead weight, not a capacity safety "
"net, so it keeps running its own ``Route()``/``ScoreAll()`` unblended."
msgstr ""
"**单独使用的** ``session-affinity`` ：完全不做自动混合。它的打分是二元的（解析出的 Pod 与其他所有 "
"Pod），因此任何小到仍会在完全平局中落败的 ``load-balance`` "
"权重，同样无法覆盖该固定绑定。混入它只是多余负担，而不是容量安全网，所以它继续单独运行自己的 ``Route()``/``ScoreAll()``"
" ，不做混合。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:322
msgid ""
"**Exclusive strategies:** ``pd``, ``slo`` / ``slo-*`` and ``external``, "
"as well as an explicit standalone ``load-balance`` selection, are not "
"blended."
msgstr ""
"**排他策略：** ``pd`` 、``slo`` / ``slo-*`` 和 ``external`` ，以及显式单独选择的 ``load-"
"balance`` ，都不做混合。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:324
msgid ""
"Both blend weights default to ``1`` (see "
"``pkg/plugins/gateway/ENV_VARS.md``). Set "
"``AIBRIX_ROUTING_AUTO_BLEND_LOAD_BALANCE_WEIGHT=0`` to disable the auto-"
"blend."
msgstr ""
"两个混合权重默认均为 ``1`` （见 ``pkg/plugins/gateway/ENV_VARS.md`` ）。设置 "
"``AIBRIX_ROUTING_AUTO_BLEND_LOAD_BALANCE_WEIGHT=0`` 可关闭自动混合。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:330
msgid "Config Profiles"
msgstr "配置 Profile"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:332
msgid ""
"A **config profile** lets you embed routing settings directly in a "
"model's pod annotation, so every request to that model picks up the right"
" configuration automatically. You can define multiple named profiles in "
"one annotation and switch between them per-request with a single header."
msgstr ""
"**config profile** 可将路由设置直接嵌入模型 Pod 的 annotation，使发往该模型的每个请求自动获得正确配置。可在一条"
" annotation 中定义多个命名 profile，并通过单个请求头按请求切换。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:335
msgid "Defining profiles"
msgstr "定义 profile"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:337
msgid ""
"Add the ``model.aibrix.ai/config`` annotation to the pod template of your"
" ``Deployment``, ``StormService``, or ``RayClusterFleet``:"
msgstr ""
"在 ``Deployment`` 、``StormService`` 或 ``RayClusterFleet`` 的 Pod 模板上添加 "
"``model.aibrix.ai/config`` annotation："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:376
msgid "Selecting a profile at request time"
msgstr "在请求时选择 profile"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:378
msgid "Two request headers drive the config at request time:"
msgstr "请求时由两个请求头驱动配置："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:380
msgid ""
"``config-profile`` selects a named profile; when absent, "
"``defaultProfile`` (or ``\"default\"``) is used. ``config-profile: auto``"
" asks the gateway to select a concrete profile from request-local hints "
"in each profile's ``routingConfig``."
msgstr ""
"``config-profile`` 选择命名 profile；缺省时使用 ``defaultProfile`` （或 "
"``\"default\"`` ）。``config-profile: auto`` 让网关根据各 profile 的 "
"``routingConfig`` 中的请求级提示选择具体 profile。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:381
msgid ""
"``routing-strategy`` overrides the selected profile's "
"``routingStrategy``, unless ``lockedRoutingStrategy`` is set (see "
":ref:`routing_strategy_priority`)."
msgstr ""
"``routing-strategy`` 覆盖所选 profile 的 ``routingStrategy`` ，除非设置了 "
"``lockedRoutingStrategy`` （见 :ref:`routing_strategy_priority` ）。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:383
msgid ""
"These request-time choices are ignored when "
"``authoritativeRoutingPolicy`` is ``true`` (see "
":ref:`authoritative_routing_policy`)."
msgstr ""
"当 ``authoritativeRoutingPolicy`` 为 ``true`` 时，这些请求时的选择会被忽略（见 "
":ref:`authoritative_routing_policy` ）。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:394
msgid "Automatic profile selection"
msgstr "自动选择 profile"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:404
msgid ""
"When ``config-profile: auto`` is used, the gateway evaluates the "
"supported request-local hints inside each profile's ``routingConfig``:"
msgstr ""
"使用 ``config-profile: auto`` 时，网关会在每个 profile 的 ``routingConfig`` "
"中评估受支持的请求级提示："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:406
msgid "A profile matches only when all of its supported hints match the request."
msgstr "只有当某个 profile 的全部受支持提示都与请求匹配时，该 profile 才算匹配。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:407
msgid ""
"If no profile matches, the gateway uses ``defaultProfile`` (or "
"``\"default\"``)."
msgstr "若没有 profile 匹配，网关使用 ``defaultProfile`` （或 ``\"default\"`` ）。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:408
msgid ""
"``promptTokens*`` uses the gateway's existing prompt text extraction and "
"local token estimation."
msgstr "``promptTokens*`` 使用网关现有的 prompt 文本提取和本地 token 估算。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:409
msgid ""
"``maxTokens*`` reads ``max_tokens`` first, then ``max_completion_tokens``"
" when ``max_tokens`` is absent."
msgstr ""
"``maxTokens*`` 优先读取 ``max_tokens`` ，缺少 ``max_tokens`` 时再读取 "
"``max_completion_tokens`` 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:412
msgid "Top-level fields"
msgstr "顶层字段"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:418
#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:436
#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:540
#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:560
#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:589
#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:618
#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:647
#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:673
#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:693
#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:731
msgid "Field"
msgstr "字段"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:419
#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:437
#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:542
#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:562
#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:591
#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:620
#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:649
#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:675
#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:695
#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:733
#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:905
#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:1100
#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:1155
#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:1197
#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:1213
msgid "Description"
msgstr "说明"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:420
msgid "``lockedRoutingStrategy``"
msgstr "``lockedRoutingStrategy``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:421
msgid ""
"Pins a single routing strategy model-wide. When set, it takes precedence "
"over the ``routing-strategy`` header, the per-profile ``routingStrategy``"
" and the ``ROUTING_ALGORITHM`` env. The remaining per-profile knobs, such"
" as ``routingConfig``, are still applied normally."
msgstr ""
"在模型范围固定单一路由策略。设置后优先于 ``routing-strategy`` 请求头、按 profile 的 "
"``routingStrategy`` 以及 ``ROUTING_ALGORITHM`` 环境变量。其余按 profile 生效的项（例如 "
"``routingConfig`` ）仍正常应用。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:422
msgid "``authoritativeRoutingPolicy``"
msgstr "``authoritativeRoutingPolicy``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:423
msgid ""
"When ``true``, treats application-supplied ``routing-strategy``, "
"``config-profile`` and ``external-filter`` headers as absent. The gateway"
" resolves ``defaultProfile``, retains its internally generated routing "
"headers, and omits routing diagnostic headers from the client response. "
"Defaults to ``false`` for backward compatibility."
msgstr ""
"为 ``true`` 时，将应用侧提供的 ``routing-strategy`` 、``config-profile`` 和 "
"``external-filter`` 请求头视为不存在。网关解析 ``defaultProfile`` "
"，保留其内部生成的路由请求头，并在返回给客户端的响应中省略路由诊断请求头。为向后兼容，默认为 ``false`` 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:424
msgid "``defaultProfile``"
msgstr "``defaultProfile``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:425
msgid ""
"Profile name used when no ``config-profile`` header is sent. Falls back "
"to ``\"default\"`` when omitted."
msgstr "未发送 ``config-profile`` 请求头时使用的 profile 名。省略时回退到 ``\"default\"`` 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:426
msgid "``profiles``"
msgstr "``profiles``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:427
msgid "Map of named profiles, each carrying the per-profile fields below."
msgstr "命名 profile 的映射，每个包含下方按 profile 的字段。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:430
msgid "Profile fields"
msgstr "Profile 字段"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:438
msgid "``routingStrategy``"
msgstr "``routingStrategy``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:439
msgid ""
"The routing algorithm for this profile (e.g. ``least-latency``, ``prefix-"
"cache``, ``pd``). See the Routing Strategies section above for the full "
"list."
msgstr ""
"该 profile 的路由算法（例如 ``least-latency`` 、``prefix-cache`` 、``pd`` "
"）。完整列表见上文路由策略一节。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:440
msgid "``requestsPerSecondPerReplica``"
msgstr "``requestsPerSecondPerReplica``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:441
msgid ""
"Per-replica RPS cap for this profile. The gateway multiplies it by the "
"model's current routable replica count to derive the effective model-wide"
" limit, so the cap scales automatically as replicas are added or removed."
" Supports fractional values (e.g. ``0.5`` for one request every two "
"seconds). Requests that exceed the limit are rejected with HTTP 429. Also"
" sets the profile's routing strategy to ``least-request``, so traffic is "
"balanced evenly enough for the per-replica figure to hold in aggregate. "
"Omit or set to ``0`` for no limit. It has no environment-variable form. "
"See :doc:`Production Model Deployments <../../production/model-"
"deployment>` for details."
msgstr ""
"该 profile 的单副本 RPS "
"上限。网关将其乘以模型当前可路由的副本数，得到实际生效的模型级限制，因此上限会随副本的增减自动伸缩。支持小数值（例如 ``0.5`` "
"表示每两秒一个请求）。超出限制的请求以 HTTP 429 拒绝。同时会将该 profile 的路由策略设为 ``least-request`` "
"，使流量足够均衡，从而让单副本的限制值在整体上成立。省略或设为 ``0`` 表示不限。它没有对应的环境变量形式。详见 :doc:`生产模型部署 "
"<../../production/model-deployment>` 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:442
msgid "``requestsInflight``"
msgstr "``requestsInflight``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:443
msgid ""
"Per-replica concurrency cap: the maximum number of in-flight requests "
"allowed on a single replica. It is enforced per pod, so it needs no "
"replica-count scaling. When every routable replica is at the cap, the "
"request is rejected with HTTP 429 and the ``x-error-model-replica-"
"inflight-exceeded`` header. Also sets the profile's routing strategy to "
"``least-request``. Independent of ``requestsPerSecondPerReplica``, and "
"the two can be set together. Omit or set to ``0`` for no limit. It has no"
" environment-variable form. See :doc:`Production Model Deployments "
"<../../production/model-deployment>` for details."
msgstr ""
"单副本并发上限：单个副本上允许的最大在途（in-flight）请求数。它按 Pod "
"生效，因此无需随副本数伸缩。当所有可路由的副本都达到上限时，请求会被以 HTTP 429 拒绝，并带上 ``x-error-model-"
"replica-inflight-exceeded`` 请求头。同时会将该 profile 的路由策略设为 ``least-request`` "
"。它与 ``requestsPerSecondPerReplica`` 相互独立，二者可同时设置。省略或设为 ``0`` "
"表示不限。它没有对应的环境变量形式。详见 :doc:`生产模型部署 <../../production/model-deployment>` 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:444
msgid "``ttftThresholdS``"
msgstr "``ttftThresholdS``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:445
msgid ""
"Time-to-first-token threshold in seconds for this profile's responses, "
"overriding ``AIBRIX_TTFT_THRESHOLD_S``. A first token arriving above this"
" value is classified as delayed in the gateway's first-token-delay "
"metric. Omit it or set ``0`` to keep the process-wide default; ``0`` "
"counts as unset, so a profile cannot set the threshold to zero, only to "
"another positive value. This affects response classification only, not "
"routing."
msgstr ""
"该 profile 响应的首 token 时间（TTFT）阈值，单位为秒，覆盖 ``AIBRIX_TTFT_THRESHOLD_S`` 。首个 "
"token 的到达时间超过该值时，在网关的首 token 延迟指标中会被归类为延迟。省略或设为 ``0`` 则沿用进程级默认值； ``0`` "
"视为未设置，因此 profile 不能把阈值设为零，只能设为另一个正数。这只影响响应的分类，不影响路由。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:446
msgid "``routingConfig``"
msgstr "``routingConfig``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:447
msgid "Algorithm-specific settings as a nested JSON object. It carries:"
msgstr "算法相关设置，嵌套 JSON 对象。它包含："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:449
msgid ""
"Auto-selection hints read by ``config-profile: auto``. Currently "
"supported hints are ``promptTokensGte``, ``promptTokensLt``, "
"``maxTokensGte`` and ``maxTokensLt``."
msgstr ""
"供 ``config-profile: auto`` 读取的自动选择提示。当前支持的提示为 ``promptTokensGte`` "
"、``promptTokensLt`` 、``maxTokensGte`` 和 ``maxTokensLt`` 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:450
msgid ""
"Strategy-specific fields, such as ``promptLenBucketMinLength`` for "
"``pd``. See :doc:`Prefill-Decode Disaggregation <pd-disaggregation>` for "
"details."
