"分离（PD） <pd-disaggregation>` 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:451
msgid ""
"Per-request routing knobs that override the matching gateway environment "
"variables for this profile's requests only. See "
":ref:`per_request_routing_knobs`."
msgstr ""
