" 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:456
msgid "Routing strategy priority"
msgstr "路由策略优先级"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:458
msgid "From highest to lowest:"
msgstr "优先级从高到低："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:460
msgid ""
"``lockedRoutingStrategy`` pinned model-wide in the config — always wins "
"when set, even over the ``routing-strategy`` header."
msgstr ""
"配置中模型范围固定的 ``lockedRoutingStrategy`` — 设置后始终优先，即使覆盖 ``routing-strategy`` "
"请求头。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:461
msgid "``routing-strategy`` request header."
msgstr "``routing-strategy`` 请求头。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:462
msgid ""
"``routingStrategy`` from the resolved profile. The resolved profile comes"
" from the concrete ``config-profile`` header, ``config-profile: auto`` "
"routingConfig hints, or ``defaultProfile``."
msgstr ""
"解析后 profile 中的 ``routingStrategy`` 。解析来源为具体的 ``config-profile`` 请求头"
"、``config-profile: auto`` 的 routingConfig 提示，或 ``defaultProfile`` 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:463
msgid "``ROUTING_ALGORITHM`` environment variable on the gateway plugin."
msgstr "网关插件上的 ``ROUTING_ALGORITHM`` 环境变量。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:465
msgid ""
"**Backward compatibility**: ``authoritativeRoutingPolicy`` defaults to "
"``false``. If a pod has no ``model.aibrix.ai/config`` annotation, the "
"gateway falls back to the ``routing-strategy`` request header and then "
"the ``ROUTING_ALGORITHM`` env (steps 2 and 4 above). No migration is "
"required for existing deployments."
msgstr ""
"**向后兼容** ：``authoritativeRoutingPolicy`` 默认为 ``false`` 。若 Pod 上没有 "
"``model.aibrix.ai/config`` annotation，网关会回退到 ``routing-strategy`` "
"请求头，再回退到 ``ROUTING_ALGORITHM`` 环境变量（即上文第 2 和第 4 步）。现有部署无需任何迁移。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:468
msgid "Locking the routing strategy"
msgstr "锁定路由策略"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:470
msgid ""
"Optionally pin a single routing strategy model-wide so it cannot be "
"overridden at request time (see :ref:`routing_strategy_priority`). "
"``lockedRoutingStrategy`` only locks the strategy: the remaining per-"
"profile knobs, such as ``routingConfig``, still follow the profile "
"selected by ``config-profile``:"
msgstr ""
"可选地在模型范围固定单一路由策略，使其无法在请求时被覆盖（见 :ref:`routing_strategy_priority` "
"）。``lockedRoutingStrategy`` 只锁定策略：其余按 profile 生效的项（例如 ``routingConfig`` "
"）仍遵循由 ``config-profile`` 选定的 profile："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:492
msgid "Authoritative routing policy"
msgstr "权威路由策略"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:494
msgid ""
"For platform-managed models whose routing policy must be authoritative, "
"also set ``authoritativeRoutingPolicy``. The gateway then treats the "
"request as if it did not contain the client routing controls ``routing-"
"strategy``, ``config-profile`` (including ``auto``), and ``external-"
"filter``. It clears them before it resolves the profile and routing "
"strategy, and it:"
msgstr ""
"对于路由策略必须具有权威性的平台托管模型，还应设置 ``authoritativeRoutingPolicy`` "
"。此时网关会把请求视为不包含客户端路由控制项 ``routing-strategy`` 、``config-profile`` （包括 "
"``auto`` ）和 ``external-filter`` 。它会在解析 profile 和路由策略之前清除这些控制项，并且："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:496
msgid "uses ``defaultProfile``;"
msgstr "使用 ``defaultProfile`` ；"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:497
msgid ""
"preserves the routing headers that the gateway itself generates after "
"selecting a pod;"
msgstr "保留网关在选出 Pod 之后自行生成的路由请求头；"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:498
msgid ""
"omits ``routing-strategy``, ``target-pod``, ``target-pod-ip``, and ``x"
"-aibrix-config-profile`` from the client response."
msgstr ""
"在返回给客户端的响应中省略 ``routing-strategy`` 、``target-pod`` 、``target-pod-ip`` 和 "
"``x-aibrix-config-profile`` 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:519
msgid ""
"``authoritativeRoutingPolicy`` and ``lockedRoutingStrategy`` have "
"separate responsibilities. The authoritative policy removes client "
"routing input; ``lockedRoutingStrategy`` pins the algorithm against both "
"the resolved default profile and ``ROUTING_ALGORITHM``. The normal "
":ref:`priority order <routing_strategy_priority>` applies unchanged: "
"request profile selection uses ``defaultProfile``, the request strategy "
"is absent, and ``lockedRoutingStrategy`` keeps its existing meaning."
msgstr ""
"``authoritativeRoutingPolicy`` 与 ``lockedRoutingStrategy`` "
"职责不同。权威策略负责移除客户端的路由输入； ``lockedRoutingStrategy`` 则把算法固定下来，凌驾于已解析的默认 "
"profile 和 ``ROUTING_ALGORITHM`` 之上。常规的 :ref:`优先级顺序 "
"<routing_strategy_priority>` 保持不变：请求的 profile 选择使用 ``defaultProfile`` "
"，请求中的策略为空， ``lockedRoutingStrategy`` 的含义也不变。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:524
msgid "Per-request routing knobs"
msgstr "按请求生效的路由参数"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:526
msgid ""
"Besides the auto-selection hints above, ``routingConfig`` carries routing"
" thresholds that override the gateway's process-wide environment "
"variables for this profile's requests only. An unset knob keeps the "
"environment default, and a value the matching environment variable would "
"reject (a negative factor, a percentage outside its range, an unknown GPU"
" name) is ignored, so a profile can only narrow or sharpen routing "
"behavior. Requests to the same model can therefore be routed with "
"different thresholds by selecting different profiles."
msgstr ""
"除上文的自动选择提示外， ``routingConfig`` 还包含一些路由阈值，可仅针对该 profile "
"的请求覆盖网关的进程级环境变量。未设置的参数沿用环境变量的默认值；若某个值会被对应环境变量拒绝（负的系数、超出范围的百分比、未知的 GPU "
"名称），则会被忽略，因此 profile 只能收窄或强化路由行为。这样，同一模型的请求可以通过选择不同的 profile，使用不同的阈值进行路由。"

