#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:698
msgid ""
"Number of ready pods the load-imbalance gate and the router score, so "
"each request reads per-pod load for ``k`` pods instead of all of them. "
"The strategies pick them: ``4k`` random ready pods, plus the pods holding"
" the prompt's longest cached prefix, are scored from in-memory estimates "
"(prefix index, local and snapshot running counts, scraped metrics) with "
"the router's blend weights; the best half are kept and the rest are drawn"
" at random. ``0`` scores every ready pod. "
"Applies only when every resolved strategy is candidate-safe (see "
"``pkg/plugins/gateway/ENV_VARS.md``). Checks that compare a pod with the "
"rest of its pool, such as the gate's spread, the prefix-cache standard-"
"deviation check and blend normalization, then compare it with the "
"candidates. Use at least ``2``: with ``1``, the one candidate is routed "
"to without scoring."
msgstr ""
"负载不均衡闸门和路由器参与打分的就绪 Pod 数量，这样每个请求只需读取 ``k`` 个 Pod 的负载，而不是全部 Pod。"
"这些 Pod 由策略自己挑选：随机抽取 ``4k`` 个就绪 Pod，再加上缓存了提示词最长前缀的 Pod，用内存中的估计值（前缀索引、本地及快照中的运行请求数、采集到的指标）"
"按路由器的混合权重打分，保留得分最高的一半，其余随机抽取。 ``0`` 表示对所有就绪 Pod 打分。仅当解析出的每个策略都是候选安全的策略时才生效（参见 "
"``pkg/plugins/gateway/ENV_VARS.md`` ）。将某个 Pod 与其所在池中其他 Pod 比较的检查，例如闸门的离散度、"
"prefix-cache 的标准差检查以及混合策略的归一化，此时比较的是候选集合。取值至少为 ``2`` ：取 ``1`` "
"时，唯一的候选 Pod 会不经打分直接被选中。"

