" VTC token tracker (at most 16 trackers per process; a profile past the "
"bound keeps the shared tracker)."
msgstr ""
"``vtc.inputTokenWeight`` 、``vtc.outputTokenWeight`` "
"、``vtc.tokenTrackerWindowSize`` 、``vtc.tokenTrackerTimeUnit`` "
"、``vtc.tokenTrackerMinTokens`` 和 ``vtc.tokenTrackerMaxTokens`` 就是以这种方式限定 "
"VTC token 跟踪器的作用范围（每个进程最多 16 个跟踪器；超出上限的 profile 沿用共享跟踪器）。"

