"(``AIBRIX_ROUTER_PREBLE_SLIDING_WINDOW_PERIOD``, "
"``AIBRIX_ROUTER_PREBLE_EVICTION_LOOP_INTERVAL``)"
msgstr ""
"preble 直方图窗口和淘汰循环（``AIBRIX_ROUTER_PREBLE_SLIDING_WINDOW_PERIOD`` "
"、``AIBRIX_ROUTER_PREBLE_EVICTION_LOOP_INTERVAL`` ）"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:764
