#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:770
msgid "External Filter"
msgstr "外部过滤器"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:772
msgid ""
"The ``external-filter`` header restricts the candidate pod pool using "
"Kubernetes label selector syntax before the routing strategy makes its "
"final selection. It is evaluated before routing and only takes effect "
"when a ``routing-strategy`` is also set."
msgstr ""
"``external-filter`` 请求头在路由策略最终选择前，用 Kubernetes 标签选择器语法限制候选 Pod "
"池。在路由之前求值，且仅在同时设置了 ``routing-strategy`` 时生效。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:774
msgid "Supported selector forms:"
msgstr "支持的选择器形式："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:776
msgid "``key=value``"
msgstr "``key=value``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:777
msgid "``key in (a, b)``"
msgstr "``key in (a, b)``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:778
msgid "``key!=value``"
msgstr "``key!=value``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:779
msgid "comma-separated list of selectors"
msgstr "逗号分隔的选择器列表"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:781
msgid ""
"See the `Kubernetes label selector reference "
"<https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/overview/working-with-"
"objects/labels/>`_ for the full syntax."
msgstr ""
"完整语法见 `Kubernetes label selector reference "
"<https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/overview/working-with-"
"objects/labels/>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:798
msgid ""
"Filtering happens **before** the routing strategy and does not change "
"which pod the strategy considers optimal."
msgstr "过滤发生在路由策略**之前** ，不会改变策略认为最优的 Pod。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:799
msgid ""
"It further narrows down the pods already selected by "
"``model.aibrix.ai/name``."
msgstr "它会进一步缩小已由 ``model.aibrix.ai/name`` 选出的 Pod 范围。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:800
msgid ""
"If the filter eliminates all pods, the request fails with ``no ready pods"
" for routing``."
msgstr "若过滤器排除了全部 Pod，请求失败并返回 ``no ready pods for routing`` 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:801
msgid ""
"``external-filter`` is optional. When omitted, no extra filtering is "
"applied."
msgstr "``external-filter`` 是可选的。省略时不做额外过滤。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:807
msgid "Request Priority Tier"
msgstr "请求优先级层级"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:809
msgid ""
"Some workloads are not latency-sensitive. A nightly batch job, for "
"example, is usually fine with answering after the interactive traffic of "
"the same model has been served. The gateway can relay that intent to the "
"backend engine: when ``AIBRIX_PRIORITY_TIER_ENABLED=true``, a request "
"that declares its tier with the ``x-aibrix-priority-tier`` header gets "
"the matching ``priority`` value set in its backend request body."
msgstr ""
"有些工作负载对延迟不敏感。例如，夜间批处理作业通常可以接受在同一模型的交互式流量处理完之后再得到响应。网关可以把这一意图转达给后端引擎：当 "
"``AIBRIX_PRIORITY_TIER_ENABLED=true`` 时，通过 ``x-aibrix-priority-tier`` "
"请求头声明层级的请求，其后端请求体中会被设置相应的 ``priority`` 值。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:815
msgid ""
"The gateway relies on the engine's own scheduler rather than queuing "
"requests itself. On vLLM, that requires the deployment to run with a "
"priority-aware scheduler such as ``--scheduling-policy=priority``, which "
"serves smaller ``priority`` values first. The mapping is therefore built "
"to only de-prioritize: a tier never makes a request jump ahead of another"
" one, so enabling the feature cannot delay interactive traffic on a "
"shared endpoint."
msgstr ""
"网关依赖引擎自身的调度器，而不是自己对请求排队。在 vLLM 上，这要求部署使用支持优先级的调度器，例如 ``--scheduling-"
"policy=priority`` ，该调度器优先处理较小的 ``priority`` "
"值。因此该映射只会降低优先级：层级不会让某个请求插到其他请求前面，所以启用该功能不会拖慢共享端点上的交互式流量。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:825
#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:1143
msgid "``x-aibrix-priority-tier``"
msgstr "``x-aibrix-priority-tier``"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:826
msgid "``priority``"
