#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:836
msgid "Unmapped tiers, and requests without the header, are forwarded untouched."
msgstr "未映射的层级以及不带该请求头的请求，会原样转发。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:848
msgid "Behavior notes:"
msgstr "行为说明："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:850
msgid ""
"The feature is off by default and the header is ignored entirely while it"
" is off."
msgstr "该功能默认关闭，关闭期间该请求头会被完全忽略。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:851
msgid ""
"Requests that already carry a ``priority`` in their body keep the value "
"the caller set, which makes an explicit per-request choice possible even "
"for a tier the table maps."
msgstr "请求体中已带有 ``priority`` 的请求会保留调用方设置的值，因此即使对表中已映射的层级，也可以按请求显式指定。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:852
msgid "Tier names are matched case-insensitively."
msgstr "层级名称的匹配不区分大小写。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:853
msgid ""
"A request that the gateway does not map is forwarded byte for byte, so "
"callers that send something else in this header see no change in "
"behavior."
msgstr "网关未映射的请求会逐字节原样转发，因此在该请求头中发送其他内容的调用方不会看到行为变化。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:871
msgid ""
"``POST /v1/decisions`` requests are never rewritten: neither vLLM nor "
"SGLang accepts a ``priority`` field there, and both reject unknown fields"
" with ``400``. ``POST /v1/systemone`` requests are rewritten like any "
"other: vLLM schedules each read by the priority, and SGLang ignores the "
"field."
msgstr ""
"``POST /v1/decisions`` 请求从不被改写：vLLM 和 SGLang 在该端点都不接受 ``priority`` "
"字段，并且都会以 ``400`` 拒绝未知字段。``POST /v1/systemone`` 请求与其他请求一样会被改写：vLLM "
"按该优先级调度每次读取，SGLang 则忽略该字段。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:857
msgid ""
"The supported tier names are fixed in this release. Per-tier values a "
"deployment can tune, and giving latency-sensitive tiers an explicit head "
"start, are candidates for a follow-up."
msgstr "在当前版本中，支持的层级名称是固定的。允许部署按层级调整取值，以及为对延迟敏感的层级提供明确的优先起步，都是后续可考虑的改进。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:862
msgid "Rate Limiting"
msgstr "限流"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:864
msgid ""
"The gateway supports per-user rate limiting on requests per minute (RPM) "
"and tokens per minute (TPM). Pass the ``user`` header with a unique "
"identifier to enable rate-limit enforcement for that client."
msgstr "网关支持按用户的每分钟请求数（RPM）和每分钟 token 数（TPM）限流。传入带唯一标识的 ``user`` 请求头，即可对该客户端启用限流。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:866
msgid "Create the user in the metadata service first:"
msgstr "先在 metadata 服务中创建用户："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/gateway-plugins.rst:889
msgid ""
"If rate limiting is not needed, the ``user`` header can be omitted. To "
"disable user RPM/TPM and model RPS quota enforcement on the gateway, set "
"``AIBRIX_DISABLE_RATE_LIMITING=true``. See "
":doc:`../../production/gateway`."
msgstr ""
"若不需要限流，可省略 ``user`` 头。要在网关上关闭用户 RPM/TPM 和模型 RPS 配额强制，请设置 "
"``AIBRIX_DISABLE_RATE_LIMITING=true``。参见 :doc:`../../production/gateway`。"

